# This is a snap PACKAGING repo. snapcraft.yaml builds paperless-ngx from
# upstream git at a pinned tag (source-tag: v3.0.5), so no application source
# belongs in here — only the packaging that wraps it.
#
# Strategy: ignore everything, then re-include the packaging files. An
# allowlist is used deliberately: a blocklist missed the 506 MB .snap and the
# 571 MB .orig, and a blob over 100 MB is rejected outright by GitHub.

/*
/.*

!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/snap/
!/SNAP_PACKAGING.md

# Build artefacts stay ignored even though snap/ is re-included above.
*.snap
*.snap.orig
parts/
stage/
prime/

# Machine-generated validation output; the durable findings live in
# SNAP_PACKAGING.md instead.
snap-validation-results.json
